    "content" : "As I mentioned yesterday, I&#39;ve been working on soldering up a CEE so I&#39;ll attach the photos I have of that to this post. The first two pictures are the bare board that I received from Kickstarter (top and bottom). The third picture includes the components that I happened to have on hand from the parts-list. The last photo is everything that I&#39;ve completed so far. I&#39;m still waiting on the ATXMEGA microcontroller to come in and to solder on the QFN parts from yesterday. I&#39;ll also have to figure out which headers I need to populate to program it.",
